Problem Statement:
You're given an array A of size n.

Alice picks any number Ai from the array.
Bob wins if he can find another number Aj such that:

Aj ≤ Ai, and

Ai / Aj (integer division) is not present in the array

You need to check if Bob can win for any choice of Ai.
If yes, return "Yes"
Else, return "No"

